{
  "language": "en",
  "probability": 0.9803459048271179,
  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.85,
      "e": 7.17,
      "text": " There are days when everything feels heavy, your responsibilities, your expectations,"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.73,
      "e": 11.79,
      "text": " your worries about the future, and even the things you never talk about."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.89,
      "e": 17.43,
      "text": " You try to stay strong, but deep down you're exhausted."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.59,
      "e": 25.93,
      "text": " But listen, you don't have to figure everything out today, take a break, slow down if you"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.93,
      "e": 26.47,
      "text": " need to."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.47,
      "e": 34.43,
      "text": " Remember, being tired doesn't mean you're weak, and taking a break doesn't mean you're giving up."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.31,
      "e": 41.09,
      "text": "You don't have to carry tomorrow's weight when you're still trying to get through today."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.25,
      "e": 44.91,
      "text": " One step at a time, that's enough."
    }
  ],
